@startuml
title Flow A/B [P0] - setup integration và Choice Card options
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor "Platform Admin" as ADMIN
actor "Product / Finance" as PF
participant "Secret Manager" as SECRET
participant "Choice Card Sync" as SYNC
participant "Giftronaut OAuth" as AUTH
participant "Giftronaut Catalog API" as GCAT
database "Provider Config Snapshot" as STAGE
participant "ELLIS Point Policy" as ELLIS
database "Published Redemption Options" as PUB
participant "OP Points API" as OPAPI

ADMIN -> SECRET : Lưu sandbox client_id/client_secret
ADMIN -> SYNC : Cấu hình secret ref + environment
SYNC -> AUTH : POST /oauth2/token\ngrant_type=client_credentials\nscope=catalog.read
AUTH --> SYNC : access_token + expires_in
SYNC -> GCAT : GET /api/v1/catalog/choice-cards\nAuthorization: Bearer token
GCAT --> SYNC : Choice Card productId + USD amount range
SYNC -> STAGE : Lưu snapshot cấu hình provider
SYNC --> ELLIS : Báo thay đổi cần review
PF -> ELLIS : Xác nhận US$10/20/50/100\nMap point cost + effective dates
ELLIS -> PUB : Publish policy version
OPAPI -> PUB : GET active published options
PUB --> OPAPI : Bốn option hợp lệ + point cost

note over STAGE,PUB
Không xây catalog thương hiệu theo quốc gia.
OP chỉ chọn mệnh giá Choice Card; thương hiệu được chọn trong link email.
end note
@enduml
